msgid "ThreadX configuration and integration"
msgstr "ThreadX 配置与接入"

msgid ""
"ThreadX adds a real additional kernel backend while retaining the static "
"factory, immutable device faces and portable wait contract. It selects the "
"official Eclipse ThreadX GNU kernel port; it does not rename FreeRTOS or "
"substitute a host scheduler model. [Backend "
"contracts](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/os/threadx/README.md) define caller storage, bootstrap proof, "
"deadlines, close/join and unsupported mechanisms."
msgstr ""
"ThreadX 增加真实内核后端，同时保留静态 factory、不可变器件接口面和可移植等待合同。它选择官方 Eclipse ThreadX GNU "
"kernel port，不是重命名 FreeRTOS 或替换成主机调度模型。[后端合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/os/threadx/README.md)定义调用方存储、bootstrap 证明、deadline、close/join 与不支持机制。"

msgid ""
"One authored assembly selects `backend = \"threadx\"`. CPU/IRQ facts remain "
"SoC facts. `tools/configure/threadx.py` validates the kernel-specific policy"
" into an independent immutable `ThreadXKernelProfileIR`. It has no invented "
"FreeRTOS idle stack, notification-slot, MPU, TrustZone or tickless "
"capability fields. CMake owns the source graph and exact dependency; the "
"typed IR supplies facts and policy, not another source graph."
msgstr ""
"唯一作者装配选择 `backend = \"threadx\"`。CPU/IRQ 事实仍归 "
"SoC。`tools/configure/threadx.py` 将内核特定 policy 校验为独立不可变 "
"`ThreadXKernelProfileIR`，不虚构 FreeRTOS idle stack、notification-"
"slot、MPU、TrustZone 或 tickless 能力字段。CMake 持有源码图和精确依赖；类型化 IR 提供事实与策略，不建立另一源码图。"

