msgid ""
"Directory names are not Board identities. Unknown Board/SoC pairings are "
"rejected. CPU-only runtime assemblies may select explicit Native or "
"Cortex-M4/M4F CPU facts; they do not establish a SoC, board route or "
"physical qualification. Cortex-M0/M0+/M3/M7/M23/M33/M55/M85 remain rejected "
"for this ThreadX backend; their separate Arch/FreeRTOS support is "
"unaffected."
msgstr ""
"目录名不是 Board 身份，未知 Board/SoC 组合拒绝。纯 CPU runtime 可选择显式 Native 或 Cortex-M4/M4F "
"事实，但不建立 SoC、板级路由或物理资格。此 ThreadX 后端仍拒绝 "
"Cortex-M0/M0+/M3/M7/M23/M33/M55/M85，其独立 Arch／FreeRTOS 支持不受影响。"

msgid "Authoring"
msgstr "编写配置"

msgid ""
"The `board` locator selects the reviewed package; its actual identity is "
"then validated. Product tasks, queue payload/depth, stack budgets and "
"startup/stop policy stay external. ThreadX priorities are backend-specific: "
"smaller numbers run before larger ones. Do not copy FreeRTOS's reversed "
"ordering into a product."
msgstr ""
"`board` 定位已审包，再校验实际身份。产品任务、queue payload/depth、stack 预算及 start/stop "
"策略留在外部。ThreadX 优先级为后端特定语义：数值小先运行，不能把 FreeRTOS 相反顺序复制到产品。"

