msgid ""
"Null/omitted OS choices use these explicit defaults; non-object values, "
"unknown fields, booleans in integer fields and invalid tuples fail. "
"`profile`, `idle_stack_words`, `notification_slots`, `tickless`, "
"`memory_protection`, `security_model`, `runtime_stats` and `lowpower_port` "
"are rejected for ThreadX. The initial port minimum is 200 caller bytes with "
"8-byte alignment; it is a fixed admission fact, not an application peak-"
"stack budget or host pthread stack budget. Timer processing in ISR is fixed;"
" there is no implicit timer worker."
msgstr ""
"OS 选项 null／省略时使用显式默认值；非 object、未知字段、整数字段 boolean 及非法组合失败。ThreadX 拒绝 "
"`profile`、`idle_stack_words`、`notification_slots`、`tickless`、`memory_protection`、`security_model`、`runtime_stats`"
" 与 `lowpower_port`。首批 port 最低调用方存储 200 字节、8 字节对齐；这是固定准入事实，不是应用栈峰值或主机 pthread"
" 栈预算。Timer 在 ISR 处理是固定选择，没有隐式 timer worker。"

msgid ""
"A PRIMASK policy preserves physical CPU BASEPRI capability but selects "
"PRIMASK kernel behavior and logical ceiling zero. BASEPRI C and ASM consume "
"the same numeric encoded ceiling. Native's `none` policy does not authorize "
"simulated hardware IRQ calls into ThreadX. PendSV is claimed for MCU "
"ThreadX; SysTick is claimed only when selected. ThreadX uses no SVC claim, "
"and an external Tick hook must bind a real source without silently retaining"
" SysTick. Existing Core monotonic time remains the deadline domain."
msgstr ""
"PRIMASK policy 保留物理 CPU BASEPRI 能力，但选择 PRIMASK kernel 行为和逻辑 ceiling "
"零。BASEPRI C 与 ASM 使用同一数值编码 ceiling。Native `none` 不授权模拟硬件 IRQ 调用 ThreadX。MCU "
"ThreadX 占用 PendSV，仅选中时占用 SysTick。ThreadX 不占用 SVC；external Tick hook "
"必须绑定真实源，不能静默保留 SysTick。既有 Core monotonic time 仍为 deadline 域。"

msgid "Linux source and evidence"
msgstr "Linux 源码与证据"

msgid ""
"The build-derived Linux timer overlay is bound to one exact reviewed "
"upstream source SHA and preserves its original MIT notice. GNU "
"`sem_clockwait` must pass a real compile/link capability probe. The timer "
"uses CLOCK_MONOTONIC for both clock observation and waits; the exact one-"
"billion-nanosecond carry is normalized. Unknown source or output is rejected"
" instead of falling back to realtime waits. The original vendor checkout is "
"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"构建派生 Linux timer overlay 绑定唯一精确已审 upstream SHA 并保留原 MIT 声明。GNU "
"`sem_clockwait` 须通过真实编译／链接能力探针。Timer 在时钟观察与等待均使用 "
"CLOCK_MONOTONIC，并规范化精确一十亿纳秒进位。未知源或输出拒绝，不回退 realtime 等待。原厂商 checkout 不变。"

msgid ""
"Development evidence separates 25 GoogleTest cases inside the real official "
"kernel, production mechanism tests with mocked external CPU/IRQ/libc "
"boundaries, configuration Python tests and actual ARM object size probes. "
"The original development record is not retained at its former repository "
"path. The retained [integration follow-up](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tests/evidence/threadx-"
"integration/README.md) contains its own actual source snapshots and raw "
"execution; it does not qualify final clean source, SDK consumption or HIL "
"and does not replace missing original bytes. Follow-up PRIMASK/configuration"
" records retain their own raw bytes and commands; original RED/GREEN records"
" are not rewritten as the implementation evolves. The [follow-up "
"record](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tests/evidence/threadx-integration/README.md) contains 50 fresh "
"cases: 30 real-kernel service cases, six real-kernel bootstrap cases and 14 "
"production mechanisms with mocked external boundaries. It also records six "
"three-Board policy links, one precise missing-Tick rejection and three CPU-"
"only integer/softfp links. These are development results, not physical "
"execution."
msgstr ""
"开发证据区分真实官方内核内 25 个 GoogleTest case、mock 外部 CPU/IRQ/libc 的生产机制测试、Python "
"配置测试及真实 ARM 对象大小探针。原开发记录未保留在原仓库路径；现存[接入后续记录](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tests/evidence/threadx-"
"integration/README.md)含自身真实源码快照和原始执行，不证明最终 clean source、SDK 消费或 "
"HIL，也不替代缺失原始字节。后续 PRIMASK／配置记录保留自身原始字节及命令；实现演进不重写原 "
"RED/GREEN。[后续记录](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tests/evidence/threadx-integration/README.md)含 50 个 "
"fresh case：30 真实 kernel service、6 真实 bootstrap、14 mock 外部边界的生产机制，并记录三板两 "
"policy 共六个链接、一个精确缺 Tick 拒绝及三个纯 CPU integer/softfp 链接。这些是开发结果，不是物理执行。"

msgid "FreeRTOS timebase lowpower selector"
msgstr "FreeRTOS timebase 低功耗选择器"

msgid ""
"FreeRTOS keeps its existing profiles. Its additive `lowpower_port` is "
"`custom` by default, retaining the explicit product port/weak-null behavior."
" Selecting `timebase` requires tickless SysTick, privileged single-world "
"operation and the reviewed STM32F407/GD32F470 timer implementation. It does "
"not authorize deep sleep. CPU-only runtime/emission rejects this selection "
"because CPU facts do not supply that SoC timer/alarm contract. This field "
"never selects a ThreadX sleep mechanism. Actual timer implementation tests, "
"physical wake latency/power and clock behavior remain separately qualified."
msgstr ""
"FreeRTOS 保持既有 profile。新增 `lowpower_port` 默认 `custom`，保留显式产品 port／weak-null "
"行为。选择 `timebase` 要求 tickless SysTick、特权 single-world 和已审 STM32F407/GD32F470 "
"timer，不授权深睡。纯 CPU runtime/emission 因 CPU 事实不提供 SoC timer/alarm "
"合同而拒绝此选择。该字段绝不选择 ThreadX 睡眠机制。真实 timer 实现测试、物理唤醒延迟／功耗／clock 行为分别建立资格。"

msgid "Repeatable software gate"
msgstr "可重复软件门禁"

msgid ""
"`python scripts/ci/os_threadx.py --compiler arm-none-eabi-gcc --output "
"<fresh-dir>` executes the production platform graph for all three maintained"
" Boards with BASEPRI and PRIMASK. Each ELF retains the real task, queue, "
"close, notification, join, timer and scheduling entry points; the two "
"official PendSV aliases must resolve to the same strong instruction entry. "
"Every official common/M4 source must have a real compiled object and the "
"same numeric C/ASM policy. The gate retains the exact ELF/BIN/map, resource "
"report, authored/resolved configuration, compiler database, command results "
"and pre/post source identities."
msgstr ""
"`python scripts/ci/os_threadx.py --compiler arm-none-eabi-gcc --output "
"<fresh-dir>` 对三块维护 Board 的 BASEPRI 与 PRIMASK 执行生产平台图。各 ELF 保留真实 "
"task、queue、close、notification、join、timer、scheduling 入口；两个官方 PendSV alias "
"必须解析为同一 strong 指令入口。每个官方 common/M4 源须有真实编译对象及相同数值 C/ASM policy。门禁保留精确 "
"ELF/BIN/map、资源报告、作者／解析配置、编译数据库、命令结果及执行前后源码身份。"

msgid ""
"A seventh build must fail specifically at the ELF link for the absent strong"
" external-Tick provider. Unrelated compiler failures, an existing ELF, weak "
"or missing retained entries, host/dynamic symbols, stale output and source "
"changes fail qualification. No command in this gate flashes or executes an "
"MCU. `configured_backends` in the compatibility policy lists available "
"selection names only; the actual resolver still rejects unsupported "
"CPU/Board tuples."
msgstr ""
"第七个构建必须明确在 ELF 链接因缺少 strong external-Tick provider 失败。无关编译失败、已有 "
"ELF、weak／缺失保留入口、host/dynamic 符号、旧输出和源码变更均不合格。本门禁没有命令烧录或执行 MCU。兼容策略中 "
"`configured_backends` 仅列可选择名称，真实解析器仍拒绝不支持 CPU/Board 组合。"
